-- A `from` block fills a required field with a field declared optional, read off a
-- selected record: refused, as `label: row.newKey` off a stored row is (Reference §14).
act Upload { note: text? } with rows
shape Parent { name: text }
shape Row { upload: one Upload, key: text, newKey: text?, parent: one Parent? }
shape Kept { other: one Other, label: text }
act Other { upload: one Upload }
rule Keep when Other { Kept from { other: this, label: first(upload.rows by key).newKey } }
